<title>CANADA: Les Gantiers drops Consoltex bid plan.</title>
<headline>Les Gantiers drops Consoltex bid plan.</headline>
<dateline>VILLE SAINT-LAURENT, Quebec 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Les Gantiers Ltd said on Tuesday a lock-up agreement it had covering 1,863,800 subordinate voting shares of Consoltex Group Inc has been ended.</p>
<p>It said it had been unable to obtain acceptable terms on financing needed to make a takeover bid for all of Consoltex's subordinate voting shares. It said on September 10, 1996 that it was considering such a bid.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
